	(descr "Semtech SX1280/SX1281 QFN-24 4x4 mm P0.5, EP 2.6 (pad 25 = data-sheet pin 0, GND). DENSE variant of ..._W: toe shortened to Z 4.40 (lands 0.60 x 0.30 at +-1.90, heel 1.60 kept) for the 4.4 mm area budget; EP land 2.70 and paste 2x2 x 1.10 mm (66 %) unchanged. Land source: SX1280/1 DS rev 3.2 Fig 17-3 p153. EP vias placed on the board (P5). | V4 (D95): SX1281 with TCXO and LDO mode: EP land 2.70 -> 1.90 (53 % of the 2.60 package pad), land holds 2x2 board GND vias at 0.90 (via-in-pad, placed on the board), paste 2x2 0.70 (49 %); XTB 6 (TCXO), DIO2 9, DIO3 10, DCC_SW 14 (LDO mode) removed")
	(tags "QFN-24 SX1280 SX1281 LoRa 2.4GHz V4 D95")
